=== Data structures ===

<!-- Important concepts:
       [x] Data structure
       [ ] Expansion
       [ ] Variables
       [x] Kinds of variables
       [x] Naming conventions
       [?] Positional parameters
       [?] Special parameters
       [x] Environment variables
